data: {"id": "c468ac30d0a14434-thinking-parallel_evidence-825", "run_id": "c468ac30d0a14434", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n   - Namespace/Pod：`aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52`，UID `78de30b1-06ec-4314-9120-26d93c29a48a`\n   - 当前状态：**Pending**，`node: <none>`，未分配任何节点\n   - PromQL 确认：`kube_pod_status_phase` 中 `phase=\"Pending\"` 为 1，其余 phase 为 0；无 waiting_reason/terminated_reason/restarts 数据（因 Pod 从未启动）\n   - 控制器链路：Pod → ReplicaSet `workload-68c557d875` → Deployment `workload`（拓扑查询证实）\n   - 容器成员：只有 `app` 一个容器\n\n2. **调度失败原因（关键证据）**\n   - kubectl_describe 显示 **FailedScheduling 事件**（59m 前首次，之后 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788763892393, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

